The lines below set various configuration options for BoltWire. Do not change the default values unless you know what you are doing. You are currently running BoltWire {version}.

blockslashes: true
cron: site.cron
cronMode: sleep
crypt: boltcrypt
honorLines: true
indexing: active
indexBatch: 25
interwiki: site.interwiki
language: 
messages: site.messages
missingMark: true
skin: 
stampsExpire: 30
threadStart: 1000
uploadMode: true
uploadSize: 2500000
uploadTypes: gif,jpg,png,txt,pdf,zip,tgz
wikiWords: false

Any installed plugins are listed below . Click here to [[action.plugins|install]] additional plugins, or here to view your [[site.plugins|installation log]]. Additional plugins can be downloaded from [[www.boltwire.com/index.php?p=resources.solutions|BoltWire]].

